WEBVTT

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:00.383
He thinks you've committed

00:15:00.383 --> 00:15:02.675
one of the worst acts of betrayal

00:15:02.675 --> 00:15:04.781
in American history.

00:15:04.781 --> 00:15:09.137
What would you say to people who think that?

00:15:10.975 --> 00:15:13.180
ES: Dick Cheney's really something else.

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:19.977
(Laughter) (Applause)

00:15:20.476 --> 00:15:25.378
Thank you. (Laughter)

00:15:25.378 --> 00:15:27.854
I think it's amazing, because at the time

00:15:27.854 --> 00:15:31.629
Julian Assange was doing some of his greatest work,